Icon Evaluator, Version 1.1, ? for help
][ Enter any Icon expression to evaluate it

.type -- toggle display of type
.list -- list expressions
.every <expression> -- show all results for expresion
.link <files>, e.g. link image,format -- link ucode files
.inc <files>, e.g. .inc x.icn y.icn -- include procedures from files
.use <file>, e.g. .use x -- load expressions from the file x
.e -- edit last expression with $EDITOR
.fix -- hack the expressions
.help or .? or help or ? -- this message
